<https://w3id.org/ci#ConstructionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A CostComponent representing a completed construction work. It combines an Activity with a WorkOfConstructionComponent to describe, in a structured form, the action performed and the physical part involved in the construction result."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ConstructionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un CostComponent che rappresenta un'opera compiuta. Combina un'Activity con un WorkOfConstructionComponent per descrivere, in forma strutturata, l'azione eseguita e la parte fisica coinvolta nel risultato costruttivo."@it .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ConstructionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Construction Work" .
