<https://w3id.org/ci#CostItem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A priced production result represented as an item in a construction cost catalogue or price list. It contains identifying, descriptive, quantitative, and economic information, including its unit price, and is semantically described through one or more CostComponents."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ci#CostItem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un risultato produttivo prezzato rappresentato come voce in un catalogo dei costi o prezzario delle costruzioni. Contiene informazioni identificative, descrittive, quantitative ed economiche, incluso il prezzo unitario, ed è descritto semanticamente mediante uno o più CostComponent."@it .
<https://w3id.org/ci#CostItem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CostItem" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ci#ProductComponent
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ci#CostComponent> .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid106 .
_:genid106 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onClass> <https://w3id.org/ci#WorkOfProductComponent> .
_:genid106 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#qualifiedCardinality> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
_:genid106 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/ci#hasWork> .
_:genid106 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/ci#TemporaryComponent> .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A CostComponent representing a product incorporated into or obtained through a production process. It combines an Activity with a WorkOfProductComponent to describe, in a structured form, the action performed and the physical product involved."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un CostComponent che rappresenta un prodotto incorporato in, o ottenuto attraverso, un processo produttivo. Combina un'Activity con un WorkOfProductComponent per descrivere, in forma strutturata, l'azione eseguita e il prodotto fisico coinvolto."@it .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Product Work" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ci#ProductionResult
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductionResult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductionResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductionResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid107 .
_:genid107 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/ci#CostComponent> .
_:genid107 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/ci#hasPart> .
_:genid107 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductionResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A result of a construction production process represented as a priced item in a construction cost catalogue or price list. In the CI ontology, a ProductionResult is equivalent to a CostItem and is described through one or more CostComponents."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductionResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un risultato di un processo produttivo delle costruzioni rappresentato come voce prezzata in un catalogo dei costi o prezzario. Nell'ontologia CI, un ProductionResult è equivalente a un CostItem ed è descritto mediante uno o più CostComponent."@it .
<https://w3id.org/ci#ProductionResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ProductionResult" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ci#TemporaryComponent
