<https://w3id.org/ci#TemporaryComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A CostComponent representing a temporary or auxiliary work required to support the execution of construction activities. It combines an Activity with a WorkOfTemporaryComponent to describe, in a structured form, the action performed and the temporary physical work involved."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ci#TemporaryComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un CostComponent che rappresenta un'opera temporanea o ausiliaria necessaria a supportare l'esecuzione delle attività di costruzione. Combina un'Activity con un WorkOfTemporaryComponent per descrivere, in forma strutturata, l'azione eseguita e l'opera fisica temporanea coinvolta."@it .
<https://w3id.org/ci#TemporaryComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Temporary Work" .
