<https://w3id.org/ci#WorkOfConstructionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Work specialization representing the physical part of a ConstructionComponent. It describes the construction object and its technical characteristics and may be decomposed into construction components, product components, and material resources."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ci#WorkOfConstructionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una specializzazione di Work che rappresenta la parte fisica di un ConstructionComponent. Descrive l'oggetto costruito e le relative caratteristiche tecniche e può essere scomposta in ConstructionComponent, ProductComponent e MaterialResource."@it .
<https://w3id.org/ci#WorkOfConstructionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WorkOfConstructionComponent" .
