<https://w3id.org/ci#WorkOfTemporaryComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Work specialization representing the physical part of a TemporaryComponent. It describes the temporary or auxiliary work and its technical characteristics and may be decomposed into product components, equipment resources, and material resources."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ci#WorkOfTemporaryComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una specializzazione di Work che rappresenta la parte fisica di un TemporaryComponent. Descrive l'opera temporanea o ausiliaria e le relative caratteristiche tecniche e può essere scomposta in ProductComponent, EquipmentResource e MaterialResource."@it .
